Lukearch ARM64 live environment marker
======================================

This live root filesystem is generated from the lukearch aarch64 archiso
profile for standard ARM64 UEFI virtual machines, including VirtualBox 7.2+
on Apple M-series Macs.

Run `sudo passwd lukearch` once to set the desktop account password. This
password is for logging in again; it does not authorize sudo.

Run `sudo lukearch-set-admin-password` once to set the separate administrator
password. It asks for the desktop account password first, then sets the root
password. After that, sudo asks for the administrator password, and the command
refuses to run again.

Generic libinput input drivers and optional GPU driver installation are
supported.
